<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">Filipianji</para>
  <para style="toc1">Epistola Cãtrã Filipianji</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filipianji</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt1">Epistola Cãtrã Filipianji</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Pavlul sh-Timoteu, huzmichearlji al Hristolu Isus, a tut popului a Dumnidzãlui tu Hristolu Isus cai suntu tu Filipii, deadun cu episcoplji sh-diaconjlji: <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Har sh-pace a voauã di la Dumnidzãlu Tatãl a nostru sh-di la Domnul Isus Hristos.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hãristisirea al Pavlu trã Filipianjlji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Hãristisescu Dumnidzãlu a meu di cãti ori tsi vã aducã aminti. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Tu cathi rugãciuni tsi fac, totãna mi rog cu harauã trã voi tuts, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />ti urtãclãchea a voastrã tu predicarea a evanghelui di dzua di prota pãnã azã. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Escu sigur cã atsel tsi apãrnji un lucru bun tu voi, va l-bitiseascã pãnã tu dzua al Hristolu Isus. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Easti ndreptu tsi mini s-minduescu ashãtsi ti voi tuts, cã vã am tu inimã. Voi tuts hits urtats tu harul tsi nji si deadi a njia tu prãnghili a meali icã tu apãrarea sh-alihipsirea a evanghelui. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Am Dumnidzãlu martir cã cum mi ardu di dor trã voi tuts cu vrearea al Hristolu Isus. <verse eid="PHP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Mini mi rog tsi vrearea a voastrã s-creascã totãna sh-ma multu tu shtintsã sh-tu achicãsiri, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />tra s-hits axi s-alidzets cai easti ma bun shi s-hits curats sh-fãrã amãrtii tu dzua al Hristos, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />umplut cu frutili a ndriptatiljei tsi yin prit Isus Hristolu trã mãrirea sh-trã alãvdarea a Dumnidzãlui.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hãpsinirea al Pavlu sh-Arãspãndirea a Evanghelui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Tora, frats shi surãri voi sã shtits cã atsea tsi nji ari undzitã a njia, agiutã ma multã trã nãintarea a evanghelui. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Ashãtsi, tut pretorium sh-tuts alantsãlji au nvitsatã cã mini escu cu prãnghi ti Hristolu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:30">Fap 28:30</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />ma multsã di fratslji sh-surãrili s-inimusirã tu Domnul di prãnghili a meali, greascã sh-dimãndu cu curaiu sh-fãrã fricã zborlu a Dumnidzãlui.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">niscãnti manuscrisi au zborlu a Dumnidzãlui, iarã alantãli manuscrisi mash zborlu.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Easti alihea, cã niscãntsã dimãndã Hristolu cu zilii sh-cu ngrãnji, ma niscãntsã cu bunã-vreari. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Aeshti dimãndu Hristolu di vrearea, shtinda cã escu bãgat trã apãrarea a evanghelui. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Iarã alantsãlji dimãndu Hristolu di ambitsili egoisti, nu cu inima discljisã sh-minduinda s-nji avdagã munduirili la prãnghili a meali. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Sh-tsi easti? Cumtsido s-hibã, cu ipucrizii icã cu alihea, Hristolu s-preadicã sh-ti aestã mi hãrsescu, sh-ma multu va mi hãrsescu. <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Mini shtiu cã prit rugãciunjili a voastri sh-cu agiutarea a Duhlui al Isus Hristos aestã va s-aducã ascãparea a mea. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Aestã ashteptu cu niarãvdari sh-nãdãescu si nu mi arushinedz tu tsiva, ma cu tut curaiulu, ca di totãna sh-tora multumãrescu Hristolu tu truplu a meu, cum prit banã, ashãtsi sh-prit moartea. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Ti mini, bãnarea easti Hristolu sh-moartea easti amintatic. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Ma, macã bana a mea tu trup fatsi tsi lucrul a meu s-aduc frut, atumtsea nu shtiu tsi s-aleg. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Escu strimtu di doauã pãrtsã: di unã parti voi s-mi dispartu di aestã dunjeauã shi s-hiu cu Hristolu, cã aestã easti ma ghini, <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />di alantã partã, macã armãnã tu trup, easti ma di ufelii trã voi. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Trã aestã escu cãndãrsit shi shtiu cã va armãn cu tuts voi tu aestã dunjeauã trã nãintarea a voastrã sh-trã hãrsirea a pistiljei a voastrã. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Ashãtsi alãvdarea a voastrã trã mini va artirseascã tu Hristolu Isus prit vinita a mea nãpoi la voi.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Acljimarea trã Ipiminisiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Voi mash bãnats cu tinjii trã evanghelu al Hristos, tsi, sh-macã yin, s-vã ved, sh-macã escu diparti di voi s-avdu cã hits deadun tu un Duh sh-tu unã minti, alumtãnda deadun trã pistea a evanghelui. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Trã atsea, nu vã aspãrats dip di dushmanjlji. Aestã aspuni cã elji ma s-duc cãtrã chireari, iarã voi cãtrã ascãparea sh-aestã yini di la Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />A voauã vã si easti datã harul trã hãtãrea a Hristolui, nu mash s-pistipsits tu nãsu, ma shi s-vã munduits trã nãsu, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />cã voi ma fãtsets idyia alumtã, cai avets vidzutã la mini sh-tora avdzãtã cã easti tu mini.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">Fap 16:19-40</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Hristolu, Urnechi trã Pistimenjlji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Trã atsea, macã voi avets vãrã inimusiri tu Hristolu, vãrã diznjirdari tu vreari, vãrã cumãnicari tu Duh, vãrã ghineatsã shi-jali, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />atumtsea fãtsets-u mplin haraua a mea, avãnda idyia mundueari, idyia vreari mpriunatã sh-tu un singur minti. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Nu fãtsets tsiva trã ambitsii egoisti, nitsi di mãriri vãnat, ma cu tãpinii, cathiunu s-lu tinjiseascã altul ma multã di cãt easti idyiul elu tinjisit. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />S-nu mutreascã cathiunu intereslu a lui, ma sh-a alantsãlor. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />S-avets sh-voi atsea mundueari tsi eara tu Hristolu Isus.<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Elu cu tutã cã avea natura a Dumnidzãlui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">nu s-lugursi ca vãrã tsiva tsi s-tsãnã vãrtos tra s-hibã isea cu Dumnidzãlu,<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />ma s-guli luãnda natura a sclavlui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">shi s-featsi isea ca oaminjlji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">shi hinda tu pãreari ca un om,<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />elu s-tãpinusi shi s-featsi cãndãrsit pãnã tu moarti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">sh-pãnã tu moartea a crutsiljei.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Trã atsea Dumnidzãlu u anãltsã tu locuri di nsus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">sh-lji deadi numa tsi easti pristi tuti numili,<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />tsi tu numa al Isus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">si s-apleacã cathi dzinucljiu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:10">a creaturilor dit tser, atsilor dit loc sh-atsilor dit sum loc,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />sh-cathi limbã s-aspunã cã Isus Hristos easti Domnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">trã mãrirea a Dumnidzãlui Tatãl.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">S-hits lunjinã tu Lumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Trã atsea, vrutslji a melji, ashãtsi cum avets fut totãna cãndãrsits nu mash cãndu earam nãintea a voastrã, ma multu ma multu tora tsi escu diparti, fãtsets-u ascãparea a voastrã cu fricã sh-cu cutrimburari, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />cã Dumnidzãlu easti atsel tsi vã da voljea sh-fuchia trã fãtseari ashãtsi cum lj-arseashti a lui. <verse eid="PHP 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Fãtsets itsido fãrã murmurari sh-fãrã ngrãnji, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />tra s-hits nivãrghits sh-nilãvushits, hilji a Dumnidzãlui fãrã cusuri namisa di unã farã disfãrnatã sh-cicãrdisit. Atumtsea voi va strãlutsits ca steali tu lumi, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />tsãnãnda vãrtos zborlu a banãljei, tsi mini s-am cu tsi s-mi alavdu tu dzua a Hristolui cã nu alãgai sh-nu lucrai di vãnat. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Ma sh-macã va mi versu ca biuturã pristi curbãnsirea sh-huzmitipsirea a pistiljei a voastrã, mi hãrsescu sh-mi alavdu deadun cu voi tuts. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Tutashã sh-voi hãrsits-vã sh-alãvdats-vã deadun cu mini.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pitritsearea al Timoteu sh-al Epafroditu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Mini nãdãescu tu Domnul Isus, s-vã pitreacã curundu Timoteul tsi sh-mini s-mi inimusescu, cunuscãnda hãljurili a voastri. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Mini nu am vãrã pi unã minti cu mini di cum am Timoteul, tsi dealihea s-cãshtigheadzã ti lucrili tsi au s-facã cu voi. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Tuts mutrescu lucrili a lor nu lucrili al Hristos. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Ma voi u-cunushtets prova a lui cã cum lji huzmitipsi deadun cu mini a evanghelui, ca hiljiu tsi lji huzmitipseashti a tatã-sui. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Nãdãescu, s-vã lu-pitrec atsel trãoarã, macãt s-ved cum va si s-duc lucrili a meali. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Sh-pistipsescu tu Dumnidzã, cã sh-mini va yin curundu.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Ma, nji pãru ananghioasã s-vã pitrec Epafroditul, fratili a meu, colucrutorlu sh-coluptãtorlu, tsi nji lu aveat pitricut ca huzmichear trã ananghili a meali. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Elu avea dor trã voi tuts shi s-nvirinã cã voi aveat avdzãtã cã elu eara niputut. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Sh-dealihea eara lãndzit di moarti, ma Dumnidzãlu avu njilã trã nãsu, sh-nu mash trã nãsu ma sh-trã mini, tra s-nu aveam nvirinari pristi nvirinari. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Trã atsea vã lu pitricui ma aĝonjea, tsi voi cãndu s-lu videts dinou, s-vã hãrsits sh-mini s-am ma putsãn nvirinari. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Ashtiptats-lu tu Domnul cu mari harauã sh-tinjisits-lji ahtãri oaminji, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />cã trã lucrul al Hristos elu eara multu aproapi di moarti, bãgãnda tu piricljiu bana a lui, tra si mplineascã lipsa a huzmitipsiriljei a voastrã cãtrã mini.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s1">Cãsãbuniljea a Noastrã Tsereascã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Tu bitisitã, frats sh-surãri, hãrsits-vã tu Domnul! Nu nj-easti greu s-vã scriu idyili lucri, ma trã voi easti sigurantsã. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Vigljeats-vã di cãnjilji, vigljeats-vã di lucrutorlji atselji arãlji, vigljeats-vã di atselji tsi s-talj tu trup! <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Cã noi him anvãrliga-tãljeatslji dealihea, cai lji huzmitipsim a Dumnidzãlui tu Duh sh-nã pirifãnsim tu Hristolu Isus, ni pistipsit tu trup, <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />cu tutã cã mini am cãtse s-pistipsescu sh-tu trup. Macã vãrã mindueashti cã ari sibepi cãtse s-pistipseascã tu trup, mini prindi s-pistipsescu ma multu. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Mini mi anvãrliga-tãljeai a opta dzuã, escu di fara al Israel, soia al Beniamin, Uvreu di Uvreilji, dupã legea un Fariseu, <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />dupã zelul, priaĝunãtor a bisearicãljei, dupã ndriptatea a legiljei, faptã fãrã cãbati. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Ma itsido tsi mini u lugurseam ca amintatic, tora u lugursescu ca chireari trã itia a Hristolui. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Meti, mini li lugursescu tuti chireari nãintea a anãltsimiljei a cunushteariljei al Hristolu Isus, Domnul a meu. Trã itia a lui mini li chirui tuti aesti sh-li vedu ca cuprii, tra s-lu amintu Hristolu, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />shi s-hiu tu nãsu, shi s-nu mi fac ndreptu prit legea, ma prit pistea tu Hristolu, va s-dzãc s-mi fac ndreptu di la Dumnidzãlu prit pistea. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Mini voi s-cunoscu Hristolu sh-fuchia a nyeariljei a lui, s-mi fac pãrtashi tu munduirili a lui, shi s-mi mpriunedz cu nãsu tu moartea a lui, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />cu nãdia s-agiungu la nyearea dit mortsã.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Nu cã mini tora am agiumtã scupolu, icã escu perfectu, ma, ma alagã dupã nãsu tra s-lu acatsã, cã sh-mini mi acãtsai di Hristolu Isus. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Frats sh-surãri, mini nu minduescu trã mini cã lu am agiumtã. Ma shtiu s-dzãc cã am agãrshat atseali tsi am alãsat dinãpoi sh-ma alag cãtrã atseali tsi am nãinti, <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />cãtrã nãetea trã amintari arãsplata a acljimariljei tsereascã a Dumnidzãlui prit Hristolu Isus. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Trã atsea, tuts tsi him criscuts, s-avem idyia mundueari. Sh-macã voi avets altã mundueari trã tsiva, Dumnidzãlu va vã u lunjineadzã aestã. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Iutsido tsi avem agiumtã, s-imnãm deadun tu idyia cali. <verse eid="PHP 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Frats sh-surãri, fãtsets-vã imitatori deadun cu mini, sh-mutrits atselji cai imnã ashãtsi dupã cum imnãm noi. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Cum vã am dzãsã di multi ori ma nãinti, sh-ma vã dzãc sh-tora cu lãcri, cã suntu multsã atselji cai bãneadzã ca dushmanji a crutsiljei a Hristolui. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Bitisirea a lor easti aspãrdzearea, dumnidzãlu a lor easti pãnticlu, sh-mãrirea a lor easti arushinea. Mintea a lor easti dupã lucrili a loclui. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Ma cãsãbuniljea a noastrã easti tu tser. Sh-noi cu niarãvdari ma ashtiptãm dit aclo Ascãpãtorlu, Domnul Isus Hristos. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Elu va lu alãxeascã truplu a nostru a tãpinusiriljei shi va lu undzeascã cu truplu a lui mãrit cu fuchia a puteariljei tsi va-sumbagã itsido sum domniljea a lui.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Trã atsea, frats sh-surãri a melji vruts shi duruts, haraua sh-curuna a mea, ashãtsi armãnets vãrtoshi tu Domnul, multu vruts!<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Lã-fac rigeai ali Evodii sh-ali Syntichi s-hibã tu un mundueari tu Domnul. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Tsã fac rigeai a tsãea, sots pistimen, s-agiuts atseali muljeri tsi au alumtat cu mini trã evanghelu, deadun cu Clementu sh-cu alantsã colucrutor a melji, tsi numili a lor suntu tu cartea a banãljei. <verse eid="PHP 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Hãrsits-vã totãna tu Domnul. Ma vã dzãc dinou: Hãrsits-vã! <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Frunimeatsa a voastrã s-hibã cunuscutã di tuts. Domnul easti aproapi! <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Nu vã angulcits trã tsiva, ma spunets-lã cãftãrili a voastri a Dumnidzãlui cu rugãciuni, cu spigiurari sh-cu hãristisiri. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Pacea a Dumnidzãlui tsi treatsi cathi aducheari, va s-veaglji ininjli sh-minduirili a voastri tu Hristolu Isus.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Tu soni, frats sh-surãri, minduits tuti cãti suntu dealihea, cãti suntu tinjisiti, cãti suntu ndreapti, cãti suntu curati, cãti suntu vruti, tuti atseali tsi au numã bunã, cãti suntu virtusiti sh-cãti suntu axii trã alãvdari. Minduits trã aesti lucri. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Atseali tsi loat, nvitsat, avdzãt sh-vidzut di la mini, fãtsets-li. Sh-Dumnidzãlu a paciljei va hibã cu voi.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pavlu Hãristiseashti Filipianjlji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Mi hãrsii multu tu Domnul cã tora tu soni voi rinoit cãshtiga a voastra trã mini. Dealihea voi u aveat tu minti, ma nu vã eara datã arastea. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Nu u dzãc aestã cã escu tu ananghi, cã mini am nvitsat s-hiu hãrsit tu itsi halã. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Mini shtiu tsi va s-dzãcã s-hii tu ananghi, shi shtiu tsi va s-dzãcã tu bulãchi. Mini am nvitsat s-hiu hãrsit tu itsi halã sh-tu itsido, sh-cãndu escu fãnãtit, sh-cãndu escu tu foami, cãndu am cu bulãchi sh-cãndu escu tu ananghi. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Mini pot s-fac itsido prit Hristolu tsi mi nvãrtusheashti. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Cu tut atsea, voi featsit ghini tsi vã aflat ningã mini tu munduirili a meali. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Voi Filipianji, shtits cã cãndu apãrnjii s-predicã evanghelu, dupã tsi fudzi dit Machidunii, vãrã bisearicã nu mi agiutã cu doari dicãt mash voi. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Cã sh-tu Sãruna ma multã di unã oarã voi nji pitricut agiutãri cãndu earam tu ananghi. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Mini nu voi doarã, ma ma multu caftu frutlu trã ufelia a voastrã. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Mini li am loat tuti sh-nji artirsescu. Am tsi nji hãrzãeashti, dupã tsi loai di Epafroditul tsi nj-aveat pitricut voi unã njurizmã bunã, unã curbani bunã-aprucheat sh-arsit di Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Dumnidzãlu a meu va si mplineascã prit Hristolu Isus tuti ananghili a voastri dupã averili a lui mãriti. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />A Dumnidzãlui sh-a Tatãlui a nostru s-lji hibã mãrirea tu eta a etilor. Amin!<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Salutats tut populu a Dumnidzãlui tu Hristolu Isus. Fratslji shi surãrili tsi suntu cu mini vã pitreac sãnãtati. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Tuts oaminjlji a Dumnidzãlui vã pitreac sãnãtati, ma ma mult atselji dit casa al Cezaru.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Harul a Domnului Isus Hristos s-hibã cu duhlu a vostru. Amin!<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>